---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Terms" description="Terms for using Botpasses: credentials, agent approvals, account suspension, licensing, and service availability." crumbs={[{ href: "/terms", label: "Terms" }]}>
  <h1>Terms</h1>
  <p>
    You are responsible for the credentials you store and for the agents you approve. You may revoke any
    agent, approval, or session from the console Access panel at any time. We may suspend accounts that
    abuse registration, token issuance, or the connector.
  </p>
  <p>
    Botpasses is free to use and open source under the MIT license. You can
    <a href="/docs/self-hosting">run it on your own infrastructure</a>. Hosted uptime is best effort. We will
    announce changes to these terms on the <a href="/changelog">changelog</a> before they take effect.
  </p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href="mailto:support@botpasses.com">support@botpasses.com</a></p>
</Base>
